 ENDF/B-VI MOD 4 Revision, June 2000, S.C. Frankle, R.C. Reedy,   2434 1451
                 P.G. Young (LANL)                                2434 1451
                                                                  2434 1451
 The secondary gamma-ray spectrum for radiative capture (MF 12,   2434 1451
 MT 102) has been updated for new experimental data at incident   2434 1451
 neutron energies up to 1 keV.                                    2434 1451
 The previous (MOD 3) pure continuum at thermal neutron energy    2434 1451
 is replaced by 89 discrete photons.                              2434 1451
 The MF=12, MT=102 yields from 1-100 keV were adjusted slightly   2434 1451
 to force energy conservation.                                    2434 1451
 The Q-value for radiative capture was also updated in File 3.    2434 1451
 Details of these changes are described in Frankel et al. [Fr01]. 2434 1451
